body":"## Landed evidence\n\nGerrit change 2166 merged as revision 781733f6d82e734c64e6b1550cd523e3a5637ee4 after LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1. CI run 32678504958 passed the documentation-only route. Gerrit reported zero unresolved comments. The merged revision is present on origin/main.\n\nThe residual-gap sweep found no deferred in-scope gaps. The full suite was skipped because the change modifies only docs/maintenance-audit-runbook.md, consistent with the approved documentation-only verification policy.","timestamp":1787533868633746001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787512792474002001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a3858dad-4f5b-4d11-ab83-377d12bdaf58","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c699-9ff7-6a7e-4ade"}],"description":"## Context\n\n`docs/maintenance-audit-runbook.md` calls the enforced module limit a soft cap and embeds dated tool inventory, machine state, measurements, findings, and capture debris as maintained procedure. The packaged `examples/agent-skills/rebar-janitor/SKILL.md` owns the audit phases. Ticket unafraid-homey-umbrette records the complexity ratchet, and scabby-slur-junk records a prior audit finding.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Rewrite the runbook as a rebar-project adapter to the packaged janitor workflow.\n- Retain project gate commands and the command inputs needed to run them.\n- Require rebar session logs and tickets for durable progress, decisions, and discovered work.\n- State that the module limit is an absolute CI gate sourced from `.github/module-size-limit.txt`.\n- Remove dated observations and capture debris from maintained procedure.\n- Refer to historical tickets when prior findings provide context.\n- Execute the documented read-only commands and run documentation link checks.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The runbook delegates audit phases to the packaged janitor skill.\n- [x] Project-specific gate commands remain documented and executable.\n- [x] Session logs and tickets are required as the durable artifacts for this repository.\n- [x] The module limit is described as an absolute CI gate sourced from `.github/module-size-limit.txt`.\n- [x] Dated machine state, measurements, findings, and capture debris are absent from maintained procedure.\n- [x] Historical context points to tickets instead of restating incident narratives.\n- [x] Documented read-only commands and documentation link checks pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/maintenance-audit-runbook.md","reason":"Replace the dated snapshot with a maintained project adapter to the janitor workflow."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","b8bf-a5aa-2f4d-44d4"],["relates_to","c699-9ff7-6a7e-4ade"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b8bf-a5aa-2f4d-44d4","parent_status_uuid":"4706cab7-57ab-4d6b-aa7a-7116d7ebfb1d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["documentation","accuracy","f38"],"ticket_id":"74dc-98da-4d2c-40b9","ticket_type":"task","title":"F38 replace the maintenance audit snapshot with a project adapter","verify_commands":[{"command":"python scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check","dd_id":"D1","dd_text":"Complexity ratchet"},{"command":"python -m pytest tests/unit/test_module_size_contract.py tests/unit/test_complexity_baseline.py::test_runbook_documents_tokens tests/scripts/test_metrics_docs.py -q","dd_id":"D2","dd_text":"Maintenance documentation contracts"},{"command":"python scripts/check_docs_index.py --check","dd_id":"D3","dd_text":"Documentation links and index"},{"command":"python scripts/check_skill_frontmatter.py","dd_id":"D4","dd_text":"Packaged skill frontmatter"},{"command":"git diff --check","dd_id":"D5","dd_text":"Changed file whitespace"}]},"source_event_uuids":["f0c8f611-a3b9-4864-b11b-be51a34c5f3b","093acf6a-30c6-4e7e-b1bd-a85a